# Zudoku build cache
.zudoku/

# dist/ is intentionally tracked — see .github/workflows/deploy.yml.
# Zudoku 0.77's CI build is flaky on our spec (intermittent codegen
# corruption), so we build locally with `npm run build` and commit
# the prerendered dist/ directly. CI just uploads it to Pages.
